<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Meddle About</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Chase Atlantic</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Nostalgia - EP</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6pNQbTZX8PrZIZHPnM4pS6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.291" end="00:26.038">Come and get it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.038" end="00:27.599">Come and get it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.599" end="00:29.107">Baby show me what you're doing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.107" end="00:30.607">Come and turn around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.486" end="00:32.764">Cause it's not just a figure of speech</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.764" end="00:34.264">You got me down on my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.232" end="00:37.155">It's getting harder to breathe out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.155" end="00:39.563">We only met each other just the other day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.563" end="00:42.486">But you already got me feeling some type of way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.486" end="00:44.645">Now if l could figure it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.645" end="00:46.198">I'd take you back to my house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.198" end="00:52.301">So we could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.301" end="00:55.633">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.633" end="00:58.431">Woah oh oh on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.431" end="01:01.524">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.524" end="01:04.551">Noo oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.551" end="01:07.736">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.736" end="01:10.407">Woah oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.407" end="01:13.060">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.060" end="01:15.820">Girl just scream it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.820" end="01:17.320">Tell me what you're thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.896" end="01:19.985">Oh l wanna see you undress now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.985" end="01:22.744">wanna hear you confess now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.744" end="01:25.129">Now oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.129" end="01:27.472">We only met each other just the other day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.472" end="01:30.475">But you already got me feeling some type of way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.475" end="01:32.627">Now if l could figure it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.627" end="01:34.167">I'd take you back to my house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.167" end="01:40.297">So we could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.297" end="01:43.525">We could medde about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.525" end="01:46.329">Woah oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.329" end="01:49.230">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.230" end="01:52.458">Noo oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.458" end="01:55.676">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.676" end="01:58.335">Woah oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.335" end="02:03.129">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.129" end="02:04.672">Back to my house so we can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.672" end="02:09.205">Back to my house so we can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.205" end="02:10.750">Meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.750" end="02:18.750">Meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.695" end="02:26.195">Come and get it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.103" end="02:27.603">Come and get it now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.520" end="02:29.111">Baby show me what you're doing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.111" end="02:30.611">Come and turn around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.560" end="02:32.622">Cause it's not just a figure of speech</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.622" end="02:34.213">You got me down on my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.213" end="02:36.861">It's getting harder to breathe out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.861" end="02:39.477">We only met each other just the other day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.477" end="02:42.610">But you already got me feeling some type of way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.610" end="02:44.627">Now if l could figure it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.627" end="02:46.171">I'd take you back to my house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.171" end="02:52.249">So we could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.249" end="02:58.755">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.755" end="03:04.410">Meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.410" end="03:07.772">We could meddle about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.772" end="03:10.397">Woah oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.397" end="03:14.397">We could meddle about</p></div></body></tt>